+    The defaults keep existing `new Todo(id, title, done)` calls compiling.
+  - `public record NewTodo(string? Title, string? DueDate = null);`
+  - `public TodoStore()` (uses `TimeProvider.System`) and `public TodoStore(TimeProvider time)`.
+  - `public IReadOnlyList<Todo> List(bool? overdue = null)`. `null` → all, `true` → overdue only,
+    `false` → not overdue. Ordered by id.
+  - `Get`, `Add`, `Update` return todos with freshly computed `Overdue`.
+  - Private helpers (names free): parse a date string or throw; compute `Overdue` for a stored todo.
+  - Tests: `class FixedTimeProvider(DateTimeOffset now) : TimeProvider` with a settable
+    `DateTimeOffset Now` and `GetUtcNow() => Now`.
